  "description": "OpenTelemetry tracing and metrics for the Plumber pipeline framework, with no OpenTelemetry SDK dependency: per-request spans and metrics are emitted through the in-box ActivitySource and Meter primitives, so you export to any backend — OTLP, Jaeger, Prometheus, or the console — with your own SDK setup. Configurable per-request enrichment.",
